{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"501436","name":"克洛琳德【洞天】","desc":"克洛琳德【洞天】","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/05/5787925/93c825610396b7c1e4514beadc7027c0_7283364815581539522.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"克洛琳德","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"编者注\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e想脱罪？赢了我就行！\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"好感套装\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e严守流程的办公准则、水之国度的斑驳色彩\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/05/5787925/4470a0f4b8ce6ec65404cfeb93a2eca2_838188795920937921.png\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"性别\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e女\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"位置\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e尘歌壶\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"功能\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e增加好感\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"职业\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e决斗代理人\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1207","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"截图\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/06/5787925/d5caf7f2a606cce5eef575329114bd89_7443150224931165631.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1208","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"好感套装对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【严守流程的办公准则好感套装对话】\u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这么一想，枢律庭确实设立过一个档案室，专门用于存储代理决斗的相关资料。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e包括起因、判决、相关人员、负责决斗的决斗代理人，以及决斗结果。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我一次都没有去过。相信我的其他同事也不愿意去。就让负责那边工作的复律官们去忙碌吧，他们总是乐在其中。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【水之国度的斑驳色彩好感套装对话】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我之前学习过一些与植物相关的知识…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e包括辨别哪些植物的根部能吃，哪些植物的果实有毒…还有哪些植物能用来制作简易染色剂。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e喔，这花坛里的植物基本无害，它们的作用是让人心情愉悦。安心观赏吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[],\"author\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"1211","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1212","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"同伴赠礼","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003ctable class=\\\"tableWrapperContent\\\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" colwidth=\\\"247\\\" data-background=\\\"rgb(233, 233, 233)\\\" style=\\\"background: rgb(233, 233, 233)\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e好感套装\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" colwidth=\\\"560\\\" data-background=\\\"rgb(233, 233, 233)\\\" style=\\\"background: rgb(233, 233, 233)\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e奖励\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" colwidth=\\\"247\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500539\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/12/28/50494840/eaa03a1cc286929907aabb686d7f5300_2858074758599412161.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"严守流程的办公准则\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500539/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500539/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/12/28/50494840/eaa03a1cc286929907aabb686d7f5300_2858074758599412161.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan cl